  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainable inclusive growth in the cashew sector of Cambodia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The CashYOU project is aiming to set up, strengthen a new value chain of organic cashew nuts in order to benefit 5,000 smallholder (indigenous) cashew farmers by teaching farmers how to grow organic, linking them to committed market players and offer them a long-term perspective.The project will contribute to sustainable and inclusive growth in the Cambodian cashew supply chain and supports to profile Cambodia as a supplier of organic cashew nuts.</narrative>
  </description>
